      ],
      "text": "Start charged. Spend one long hop on the first water gate.\nThen 25 completed short hops refill it; waiting does not."
    },
    {
      "pos": [
        10,
        36
      ],
      "text": "Follow the winding terrace.\nForward short hops refill the reserve without pacing in place."
    },
    {
      "pos": [
        4,
        31
      ],
      "text": "The road advances when you hop.\nUse the lookout pocket to line up its next position."
    },
    {
      "pos": [
        10,
        24
      ],
      "text": "Second water gate. Check the counter before you jump.\nThe dry bank leaves room to finish any missing short hops."
    },
    {
      "pos": [
        10,
        22
      ],
      "text": "Only checkpoint. Follow the next recharge circuit.\nCharged-rule retries refill your reserve."
    },
    {
      "pos": [
        10,
        8
      ],
      "text": "Last gate. Save your long hop for water.\nOn the far bank, circle the rail or hop when recharged."
    }
